The Dynamic Button driver's Button tab includes icons from two icon collections, listed
below with their licenses. They are stored as SVG path data in
drivers/dynamic_button/www/html/index.html, written by tools/bundle_icons.py from the
names in tools/bundled-icons.txt, unmodified apart from their color.

